Done on the way back up from mines end, and only in
extreme circumstances.  I'll only kill a cross aligned
temple priest if I've found no other altars until
somewhere between Oracle and Medusa.  I'll only kill
a coaligned temple priest if I've found no other
altars until at least the Quest.

Dig out one of the walls.  Gather every rock from
everywhere.  Pile them where the wall was, in piles
named so you can pick up each pile without becoming
burdened.  One by one pick up those piles of rocks
and throw them at the priest.  Keep going until the
priest is dead or you've run out of rocks.  If you
run out of rocks it's because you had under 200 and
forgot the part about every rock from everywhere.
If you run out of rocks the priest will be in perfect
health when you try next time, so don't even start
throwing until you have an overwhelming number of
rocks.

Since killing a priest has its price, be prepared
to use the altar on a sacfest until the price has
been repaired.



